sparky-ca (2.0.1) forky; urgency=medium

  * Remove the integration with KIO's certificate manager and the dependency
    on a patched KIO: KIO and Qt already trust the system store
  * Import the chosen chain into gpgsm for Kleopatra and KMail; a root is
    trusted only when you confirm it yourself, never silently
  * Take back the trust entries that 2.0.0 added to gpgsm without asking
  * Install on every SparkyLinux edition: gpgsm and Kleopatra are optional and
    the feature appears only where gpgsm exists

 -- Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>  Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0000

sparky-ca (2.0.0) forky; urgency=medium

  * Rebuilt on Qt 6 and KDE Frameworks 6: a Kirigami application, a System
    Settings module, a KAuth helper, a numbered text menu and script
    commands, all from one core
  * Verified catalogue of ICP-Brasil certificates with pinned roots, ITI's
    hash and signed CRLs
  * Installs in the system, Waterfox, Firefox and Chromium and removes only
    what it installed
  * Imports A1 certificates and registers A3 token modules without storing
    PINs
  * Keeps the chosen groups current with a daily timer that can be turned off
  * Complete Brazilian Portuguese and Polish translations

 -- Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>  Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
